Sumy: A warehouse containing sulfur-based substances was struck.

Following an airstrike in the vicinity of Sumy, a fire broke out at storage facilities holding sulfur-containing materials, according to the head of the Sumy Oblast Military Administration. Residents of the Bezdritskaya, Verkhnesyrovatskaya, and Krasnopolskaya communities have been urged to stay indoors, close windows, and limit outdoor activity due to a possible sulfur smell in the air.

